    <description>Places a lost key fob order at the handbook fee of 75 USD. The amount is not an input. An open Key Fob Order Case for this apartment is returned without another SmartRent call. Otherwise SmartRent is called with the apartment id, and a Closed Case is created only after a successful order.</description>
    <ends>
